# Generated inputs for the content build. Regenerated in ~3 minutes by
# Scripts/Setup-Project.ps1 (or the two Tools/*/generate_*.py scripts), so they
# are not worth ~150 MB of history.
Tools/Terrain/Output/
Tools/Audio/Output/

# The map, for the same reason and one harder one. It is rewritten whole by
# every content build, and at the 4033 landscape it is ~195 MB - past GitHub's
# 100 MB per-file hard limit, so it cannot be pushed at all. Everything else
# under Content/ is small (~5 MB) and stays committed; the map is rebuilt by
# Scripts/Setup-Project.ps1 or Scripts/Build-Content.ps1.
Content/Maps/*.umap
__pycache__/
*.pyc
